*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*Manufacturer: "DeadlineDriven"
*ModelName: "X3 Thermo (Bluetooth)"
*Product: "(X3 Thermo Snap & Tag)"
*NickName: "X3 Thermo (Snap & Tag Bluetooth) 300dpi"
*ShortNickName: "X3 Thermo"
*PCFileName: "x3thermo.ppd"
*Throughput: "1"

*PageSize X3Label/X3 Label 42,3x250 mm: "<</PageSize[120 708]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion X3Label/X3 Label 42,3x250 mm: "<</PageSize[120 708]>>setpagedevice"
*DefaultPageSize: X3Label
*DefaultPageRegion: X3Label
*ImageableArea X3Label/X3 Label 42,3x250 mm: "0 0 120 708"
*PaperDimension X3Label/X3 Label 42,3x250 mm: "120 708"
*HWMargins: "0 0 0 0"

*DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 dpi: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"

*cupsColorSpace: Gray
*cupsColorOrder: chunky
*cupsBitsPerColor: 8
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*ColorSpace Gray/Graustufen: ""

*OpenUI *X3Brightness/Druckdunkelheit (Helligkeit): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *X3Brightness
*DefaultX3Brightness: 100
*X3Brightness 70/Hell (70%): ""
*X3Brightness 100/Normal (100%): ""
*X3Brightness 130/Dunkel (130%): ""
*X3Brightness 160/Sehr dunkel (160%): ""
*CloseUI: *X3Brightness

*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf 0 x3raster"
*cupsFilter2: "application/postscript 30 x3raster"

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier/Courier: Standard "(0.00) Standard Font"
*Font Courier-Bold/Courier-Bold: Standard "(0.00) Standard Font"
